# game shows one on the sphere's hover in "your places", after its own lead-in ("Feels unfair to her: " or "Feels fair
# to him: "), so each is a clause: lower case, no end stop, true of any event in that sphere, and naming no type of
# person (the reader is told by what they notice, never by who they are).
